    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mannequin: Factory</i>, you play as a lone worker assigned to a weekend shift at a mannequin manufacturing plant. Your routine seems straightforward: check emails, assemble parts, pack boxes, and load the truck. But it quickly becomes clear\u2014you\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Work simulation gameplay</strong>: Use your computer, organize parts, and assemble full mannequins to complete delivery orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Dynamic tension system</strong>: Scares and paranormal events escalate based on your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Atmospheric horror</strong>: Low lighting, eerie audio design, and subtle environmental storytelling create constant unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Replayable scenarios</strong>: Orders and events are varied, ensuring different experiences on each playthrough.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mannequin: Factory</i>, you play as a lone worker assigned to a weekend shift at a mannequin manufacturing plant. Your routine seems straightforward: check emails, assemble parts, pack boxes, and load the truck. But it quickly becomes clear\u2014you\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Work simulation gameplay</strong>: Use your computer, organize parts, and assemble full mannequins to complete delivery orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Dynamic tension system</strong>: Scares and paranormal events escalate based on your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Atmospheric horror</strong>: Low lighting, eerie audio design, and subtle environmental storytelling create constant unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Replayable scenarios</strong>: Orders and events are varied, ensuring different experiences on each playthrough.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Assemble and pack orders in a mannequin factory. It's your weekend shift alone and your job is simple... But something's off.",
